{"path":"string/basic_string/size","title":"std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::size, std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::length","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;::</span>size, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;::</span>length","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string/size","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the number of CharT elements in the string, i.e. std::distance(begin(), end()).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size_type size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(noexcept since C++11)</span><br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size_type length<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(noexcept since C++11)</span><br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the number of <code>CharT</code> elements in the string, i.e. <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/distance\"><span class=\"kw678\">std::<span class=\"me2\">distance</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The number of <code>CharT</code> elements in the string.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-until-cxx11\"><td>\n<p>Unspecified\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx11\"><td>\n<p>Constant\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>For <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\">std::string</a></span>, the elements are bytes (objects of type <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span>), which are not the same as characters if a multibyte encoding such as UTF-8 is used.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> s<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Exemplar\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>s.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> s.<span class=\"m